        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-C2, Navajo Mount Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Navajo Stepped Scalloped Towel Bar is rich with the southwest design aesthetic, making it a must have for ranch-styled homes. It is available in a 18 inch, 24 inch, and a 30 inch length; all of which are simple to install with the included hardware pack. As part of Fusion Hardware's Navajo Collection, it is available in 3 finishes. Choose from antique copper, antique pewter, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/navajo-collection-towel-ring-fusion-tr-c2\"><b>Fusion TR-C2 Navajo Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/navajo-robe-hook-fusion-rh-c2\"><b>Fusion RH-C2 Navajo Robe Hook</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/navajo-toilet-tissue-holder-fusion-ph-c2\"><b>Fusion PH-C2 Navajo Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-C2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-C2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-C2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
